<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef higher on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select and Choice round and loin cuts sharply higher, while chuck cuts higher and rib cuts firm.  Beef trimmings weak on light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>------</p>
<p>267 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p> 13 50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>20 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     108.86	108.58	103.02	101.84</p>
<p>Changes	   1.66	  1.20	  1.33	  0.72</p>
<p>Rib	  163.19	162.55	152.59	152.62</p>
<p>Chuck	 75.81	 73.33	 76.73	 72.72</p>
<p>Round	 95.07	 95.07	 90.74	 90.74</p>
<p>Loin	 174.33	176.83	155.46	155.48</p>
<p>Brisket     60.58	 60.58	 60.72	 60.72</p>
<p>Shrt Plate  70.11	 70.02	 70.37	 70.19</p>
<p>Flank	 60.64	 60.64	 60.35	 60.35</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
